            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say I go to school every day. Then ਖਾਣਾ and ਪੀਣਾ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "grammar",
          "title": "Grammar Lens: ਖਾ and ਪੀ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਖਾ and ਪੀ end in vowels too, so they work like ਜਾ: ਖਾਂਦਾ, ਖਾਂਦੀ; ਪੀਂਦਾ, ਪੀਂਦੀ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਮੈਂ ਰੋਜ਼ ਰੋਟੀ ਖਾਂਦਾ ਹਾਂ। — maiṁ roz roṭī khāndā hāṁ. — I eat roti every day (a man speaking)."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਉਹ ਰੋਜ਼ ਦੁੱਧ ਪੀਂਦੀ ਹੈ। — uh roz duddh pīndī hai. — She drinks milk every day."
            }
          ]
        },
