              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU HEAR: *I drink water every day, as a woman*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say ਮੈਂ ਰੋਜ਼ ਪਾਣੀ ਪੀਂਦੀ ਹਾਂ।."
