      "romanization": "asīṁ roz chāh pīnde hāṁ.",
      "gloss": "we drink tea every day: the -ਦੇ form for a group and for respect",
      "script": "gurmukhi",
      "modality": "voice",
      "derivedModality": "voice",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "no-visual-dependency"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:62663e7fbb012560",
      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say I drink tea every day. Then the familiar ਅਸੀਂ ਮਿਲਦੇ ਹਾਂ, \"we meet\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "grammar",
          "title": "Grammar Lens: -ਦੇ for more than one",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਮਿਲਦੇ showed the -ਦੇ ending for ਅਸੀਂ. The vowel stems take it too, nasal and all: ਜਾਂਦੇ, ਖਾਂਦੇ, ਪੀਂਦੇ. ਤੁਸੀਂ takes it as well, with ਹੋ:"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਅਸੀਂ ਰੋਜ਼ ਚਾਹ ਪੀਂਦੇ ਹਾਂ। — asīṁ roz chāh pīnde hāṁ. — We drink tea every day."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਤੁਸੀਂ ਰੋਜ਼ ਸਕੂਲ ਜਾਂਦੇ ਹੋ। — tusīṁ roz sakūl jānde ho. — You go to school every day."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "HEAR",
              "instruction": "we eat roti every day",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU HEAR: *we eat roti every day*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say ਅਸੀਂ ਰੋਜ਼ ਰੋਟੀ ਖਾਂਦੇ ਹਾਂ।."
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
